B.a_g=new A.d5("The Big Sandwich","Noah makes lunch for a picnic. He adds cheese, tomato, and crisp lettuce. The sandwich is very tall. He cuts it into four parts so everyone can share.")
B.a_j=new A.d5("Moon Shapes","The moon looks round tonight. Last week it looked like a thin smile. We draw each shape in a notebook. The moon changes, but it is always the same moon.")
